# Phase evidence for this maintenance fork: docs/reports/{STATE,AUDIT,PLAN,VERIFY}.md.
# This repo is public and these files may quote raw journal lines, window
# titles or resolved temp paths, so they stay local-only. The pattern has no
# leading slash, so `reports/` matches at any depth — including docs/reports/.
# Tier 1 S8 asserts the rule exists and that nothing under it is tracked.
reports/
